r\nFollows [VehicleWheel3D](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_vehiclewheel3d.html#class-vehiclewheel3d) reference values for car mass, damping, suspension stiffness, friction slip.\r\nAlso slightly reduce default wheel radius.\r\n\r\nTried using the TruckTown demo as reference for testing, but there are some hardcoded speed values that made it quite bad. In my own case, these values worked with slightly higher slip and very high damping values for a formula 1 like arcade car.\r\n\r\n#### Additional work: \r\n- It seems overriding RigidBody3D's mass property hint would require refactoring parts of the engine's core? The idea would be to change the range to ~500-5000\r\n- Maybe also change default suspension max force?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX